WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.610 --> 00:00:04.821
a we have now learned that Donald and Melania
Trump received their covid vaccines at the

00:00:04.821 --> 00:00:07.310
White House in January, but kept it secret.

00:00:07.310 --> 00:00:11.690
I will talk a little bit about why it's believed
that they kept it secret.

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:17.630
But unfortunately, I think there is no way
to deny that Donald and Melania Trump, keeping

00:00:17.630 --> 00:00:23.570
their covid vaccinations secret for months
led to some deaths that could have been prevented.

00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:25.760
And I'll explain why momentarily.

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:30.550
CNN reporting that Trump and Melania received
the covid-19 vaccine in January.

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:33.890
This is per a Trump adviser talking to CNN.

00:00:33.890 --> 00:00:37.150
It wasn't clear which of the vaccines they
received.

00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:40.340
It wasn't clear how many doses they received.

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:45.540
And this was something that the question of
this came up and it came up on my stream on

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:48.980
Sunday as we were covering Donald Trump's
CPAC speech.

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:51.190
Donald Trump said everybody should get the
vaccine.

00:00:51.190 --> 00:00:55.260
And, of course, his goal in saying that was
a political goal and taking credit for the

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:58.970
vaccine and saying, hey, I got us the vaccine,
everybody should get it.

00:00:58.970 --> 00:01:01.980
This immediately raised the question.

00:01:01.980 --> 00:01:07.150
As Donald Trump told the audience, the vaccine
is very unpatentable, unusual choice of terms,

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:08.580
but it's Trump, OK?

00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:11.700
It raised the question, did Trump get the
vaccine?

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:12.791
We know Joe Biden did.

00:01:12.791 --> 00:01:17.450
Trump even mentioned it, saying, my work on
vaccines got Joe a vaccine.

00:01:17.450 --> 00:01:21.680
And the question became, did Trump get the
vaccine?

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:27.900
In December, the White House said Trump wasn't
going to be given a vaccine until it was recommended

00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:32.710
by the White House medical team and that Trump
was still receiving the benefits of that antibody

00:01:32.710 --> 00:01:38.080
treatment he got when he had covid-19 and
that that was that.

00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:43.460
We've now learned that Trump accepted the
vaccine while still president at the White

00:01:43.460 --> 00:01:45.409
House in January.

00:01:45.409 --> 00:01:49.590
No public fanfare, no public announcement.

00:01:49.590 --> 00:01:55.040
And now the question is, could lives have
been saved if it had been publicly known that

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:56.510
Trump had been vaccinated?

00:01:56.510 --> 00:01:59.140
I believe the answer is yes.

00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:05.400
We won't ever know how many and we won't ever
be able to point to who.

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:10.410
But one of the most vaccine hesitant groups
in the country is Republicans, we previously

00:02:10.410 --> 00:02:17.230
spoke about how folks without college degrees,
black folks and Republicans are the three

00:02:17.230 --> 00:02:23.010
most anti covid vaccine groups in the country
for different reasons.

00:02:23.010 --> 00:02:28.510
Republicans have much of their opposition
or lack of interest in the covid vaccine,

00:02:28.510 --> 00:02:33.290
based in the constant disinformation that
came from Donald Trump's White House, that

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:37.290
this isn't that serious and that we can get
back to normal without a vaccine and so on

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:38.290
and so forth.

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:42.090
So there's no doubt that there are can we
say thousands?

00:02:42.090 --> 00:02:48.319
Could we say tens of thousands of Republicans
who did not get vaccinated?

00:02:48.319 --> 00:02:54.129
Had they known Trump had been vaccinated in
January, many of them would have gotten a

00:02:54.129 --> 00:02:55.129
vaccine.

00:02:55.129 --> 00:03:00.160
And simply statistically speaking, some of
them got covid and died because they didn't

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:01.160
get the vaccine.

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:05.240
And they would have had they known Trump had
gotten it and was saying in January, everybody

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:09.459
should get it instead of waiting until February
28th to say everybody should get it.

00:03:09.459 --> 00:03:11.010
We won't know exactly how many.

00:03:11.010 --> 00:03:12.599
We won't know exactly who.

00:03:12.599 --> 00:03:18.459
But there is no question that this is the
latest action by Donald Trump that caused

00:03:18.459 --> 00:03:21.800
some deaths, some deaths that could have been
prevented.

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:30.489
We now have a study which suggests 40 percent
of the covid deaths during the Trump presidency

00:03:30.489 --> 00:03:32.269
were due to bad policy.

00:03:32.269 --> 00:03:35.030
Of course, we were going to have many deaths.

00:03:35.030 --> 00:03:40.909
This ravaged just about every country in the
world, but 40 percent of them were because

00:03:40.909 --> 00:03:45.379
of bad management by the federal government
and by state governments as well.

00:03:45.379 --> 00:03:52.440
And certainly Trump keeping his vaccine a
secret for months only made that even worse.

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:55.830
We will have more coverage of this on The
David Pakman Show Instagram.

00:03:55.830 --> 00:05:00.729
